Oops. I made a mistake. Thanks for spotting.

Model 2 should be:

twogroupmodel <-
   "y1 ~ c(a, b) * 1  # intercept
    y2 ~ c(c, d) * 1  # intercept

    y1 ~~ c(v1, v1) * y1
    y2 ~~ c(v2, v2) * y2
    y2 ~~ c(v12, v12) * y1

    diff1 := b - a
    diff2 := d - c"

The variances and covariances must be constrained to be equal.

J

