Dear lavaan users,

A somewhat belated announcement, but lavaan 0.6-3 has arrived (last week) at CRAN. To install, simply type in R:

install.packages("lavaan")

and restart your R session.

The release notes can be found here: http://lavaan.ugent.be/history/dot6.html

Yves.

